{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Fridge Mind 是一款智能廚房助理，可整理雪櫃各區食材、追蹤到期日並在食物過期前提醒，亦會依據現有食材以 AI 推薦個人化食譜；適合想減少浪費、節省購物時間及吃得更健康的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-143.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>智能管理雪櫃食材</h2>\n<p>Fridge Mind 支援掃描條碼自動辨識產品，亦可手動新增及編輯食材；可把產品分配到主冷藏、冷凍、櫃門及抽屜，並追蹤到期日與接收過期前通知。AI 會按雪櫃現有食材生成個人化食譜，優先使用即將到期產品，另提供購物清單、食用與浪費統計及效率分數，協助減少食物浪費。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-603-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-604-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-605-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-606-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-607-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-608-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Fridge Mind – AI Recipes</li><li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/fridge-mind-ai-recipes/id6757429973?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:03:57.581785+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:38:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:23:42.119809+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:59:26.004977+00:00","content_hash":"1752f977edb65f177bb9022a19f26206749fcd23834a828e9f93810cc1c65db4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}